 *
 * Decoded values map back as:
 *
 *     i<n>e                ->  BigInt          (unbounded, like a Python int)
 *     <len>:<bytes>        ->  ByteString      (Python bytes, never decoded to str)
 *     l...e                ->  Array
 *     d...e                ->  Map keyed by ByteString
 *
